  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sy Cereal Production and Marketing Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cereal marketing, Beneficiaries: 858 (370 women), Description: The project will increase the cereal marketing capacity of the union through improved access to production inputs and advice, post-harvest grain treatment, increased capability to supply larger tenders for grain delivery, and improved financial and administrative management of the Union.</narrative>
  </description>
